  "notes": "{暴落|ぼうらく} indicates an extreme, often catastrophic price collapse. It's more severe than {急落|きゅうらく} and often describes market crashes. The opposite is {暴騰|ぼうとう}.\n\n{暴落|ぼうらく} vs. {急落|きゅうらく}:\n- {急落|きゅうらく}: sharp drop (significant decline)\n- {暴落|ぼうらく}: crash, collapse (extreme, often panic-driven)\n\nRelated terms:\n- {暴騰|ぼうとう}: skyrocketing\n- {急落|きゅうらく}: sharp drop\n- {大暴落|だいぼうらく}: major crash",
